Cell["\<\
Now we must use this solution to compute the solution for the original \
variables. To work out the solution for \[Beta] we use the \[Alpha]\[Beta] \
relation derived above.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.989351647950365*^9, {3.9893517757330847`*^9, 3.989351791359427*^9}, 
