Cell["\<\
This method above only gives \[Beta]1 because if we solve the above without \
/.uSol, we see both \[Beta]0 and \[Beta]1 have a 1-u0^2-u1^2 in the \
denominator so we can only solve for one in terms of the other. We use the d\
\[Chi] equation to solve for \[Beta]0.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.989352118446315*^9, 3.989352118933614*^9}, {
  3.989352159750147*^9, 3.989352163195477*^9}, {3.989352403162291*^9, 
  3.989352475826662*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7bb1332e-0b7b-4f76-aecd-\
8b2c1fbe5a72"],

