Cell["\<\
Before integrating to find the position as a function of s, we check that v \
and \[Beta] satisfy the original equations. We also do a reparameterisation. \
The reparameterisation is done so that \[Tau] represents the proper time \
along the curve.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.989352782644898*^9},ExpressionUUID->"b437d631-d48b-4b5f-b8df-\
de2c56a5cbac"],

