Cell["\<\
Now we check the original CGEs are satisfied. Mathematica finds it easier if \
we first find a new solution in terms of \[Tau], rather than substitute \
\[Tau] in all at once. The \[Tau]Sol function just does a bunch of algebra.\
\>", "Text",
