Cell[TextData[{
 "Now we find expressions for our integration constants in terms of the \
initial covector and radial velocity.  Note that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["C", "2"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "40e92299-5be5-4c6d-bea4-61e5d040a9de"],
 " has two solutions, only one of which is real. We will still mainly work in \
terms of the original constants but will use these expressions to choose \
initial conditions later."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.989359150284326*^9, 3.990141214359886*^9, {3.990746645666238*^9, 
