Cell["\<\
If we didn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t insist that our initial frame be hypersurface \
orthogonal then we would be free to choose dr0 as we desire. Now we define a \
function that generates replacement rules for specific initial surfaces.\
\>", "Text",
